  m_text: 'This project will walk you through some of the core components and modules
    of the toolkit. Once you are done with the experience, we recommend checking
    out the sample source to dig into details on how things were achieved.


    Throughout
    this experience, you''ll be learning about the most important toolkit modules.
    These include:


    - RealityToolkit.Core

    - RealityToolkit.Player

    -
    RealityToolkit.Locomotion


    The Reality Toolkit is designed to be platform
    agnostic. To make the experience run on your device, it is making use of additional
    packages for platform bindings, such as:


    - RealityToolkit.Pico

    - RealityToolkit.MetaPlatform'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
